abstract: "Finite graph-to-topology simulator associated with Uphill graph topologies and degree-constrained realizations of posets. Version 1.12.1 provides the newer interface; the independently reviewed paper supplement remains version 1.11.2. Finite computations illustrate examples and do not prove manuscript theorems."
keywords:
  - graph topology
  - finite topology
  - posets
  - supplementary software
